WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:11.490
My, how splendid!

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:12.620
Truly splendid!

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:16.360
No other royal house in Europe
owns such a magnificent piece.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:20.430
His Majesty grants Madame du Barry's
every wish, doesn't he?

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:22.060
Indeed, he does!

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:29.000
After all, His Majesty's affections
all belong to Madame du Barry.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.590
It's no surprise that they do.

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:32.640
My, how stunning!

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.280
It suits you so well.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:38.260
Yes, it's as though it were made
for Madame du Barry.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:40.050
It's so beautiful.

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:42.450
It truly looks magnificent on you.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:44.780
Viscountess,

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:48.320
about our discussion the other day concerning
your husband's appointment to office.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:50.280
I have spoken to His Majesty about it.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:51.240
My!

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:54.700
Would the position of Commander
of the French Guards suffice?

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:57.570
An official order should be issued
within two to three days.

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:00.070
Oh, Madame du Barry!

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:03.330
Thank you! Thank you very much!

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:05.440
Now, now, you shouldn't...

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:07.930
Please raise your head.

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:18.580
It's an emergency!

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:20.970
I-It's His Majesty!

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:22.320
His Majesty has...!

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:23.900
What is the matter with His Majesty?!

00:01:24.690 --> 00:01:25.860
He has collapsed!

