00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:06.960
episode

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:06.960
"The Sun
\h         Sets, the Sun Rises"

00:03:08.380 --> 00:03:11.910
<i>On April 27, 1774,</i>

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:18.020
<i>King Louis XV suddenly collapsed from
fatigue and a headache while hunting.</i>

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:24.500
<i>He was immediately taken to the Palace
\h of Versailles, and the King was examined...</i>

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:29.860
<i>...by a team of fourteen doctors, consisting of six physicians, five surgeons and three pharmacists.</i>

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:35.570
Her Royal Highnesses,
Lady Victoire and Lady Adélaïde!

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:38.010
How is His Majesty's condition?

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:40.180
And what is his illness?

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:43.350
Well... I'm afraid we do not know yet.

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:47.030
The doctors are doing their best and
examining him, but to no avail...

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:55.670
Your Majesty, please be strong!

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:01.800
What are you doing?!

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:03.510
Haven't you figured out the cause yet?!

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:07.470
Well, we have done everything
we can, but I'm afraid...

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:10.680
<i>He can't....</i>

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.510
<i>No! His Majesty will be well soon enough!</i>

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:16.480
<i>Yes, of course! He's just fatigued!</i>

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:19.050
<i>I can't have him die this soon!</i>

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:21.150
<i>There are so many things I still want to do...</i>

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:23.620
<i>So many things I still desire!</i>

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.420
<i>I refuse to lose!</i>

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.680
Don't worry.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.810
His Majesty will recover in no time.

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:47.850
Of course he will.

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:08.030
It's perplexing...

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:09.770
Just what could it be?

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:11.330
What is the cause?

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:14.070
We have done everything we can.

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:15.620
Only God can help us now.

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:20.130
You there.

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:23.920
Please dim His Majesty's candles.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:26.380
Even the slightest bit of light
can bother the patient's eyes.

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:26.720
Yes, Sir.

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:37.390
Doctors! P-Please, come quickly!

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:43.860
Th-These red spots are...!

00:05:44.170 --> 00:05:45.800
I-It's smallpox!

00:05:57.150 --> 00:05:57.830
It can't be!

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:59.290
S-Smallpox?!

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:02.490
Please leave this area at once!

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:04.820
Go to the farthest room possible
from His Majesty's sickroom!

00:06:04.820 --> 00:06:06.350
But we must visit His Majesty...!

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:08.990
We must avoid the infection from spreading!

00:06:08.990 --> 00:06:11.770
This is an instruction set by law that
the heir to the throne must follow!

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:20.000
Your Majesty, please be strong!

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.190
We are also here by your side, Your Majesty!

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:24.440
<i>He has to recover...</i>

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:26.780
<i>He has to recover no matter what!</i>

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:29.160
<i>What would become of my position?!</i>

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:32.220
<i>Your Majesty, please pull through this!</i>

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:36.620
<i>Otherwise, our days of glory as the King's
daughters will come to an end!</i>

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.490
What? His Majesty is...?!

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:51.370
If he should pass away...

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:54.270
We must think carefully before we act.

00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:55.040
Indeed.

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:59.140
Pledge our loyalty to the dying or
entrust our hopes to the new King...

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:01.850
Pledge to the setting sun or the rising sun...

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:05.720
Still, it's not certain that he will die yet.

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:08.480
It's a tough call to know which way to bet.

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:21.830
We must consider things carefully, as well.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:24.890
Yes, Lady Antoinette or Madame du Barry?

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:36.280
What is the real story behind
His Majesty's condition?

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:38.110
Will he live or will he not?

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:41.750
Well, his face has been terribly
disfigured and is suffering,

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:43.860
but his internal organs haven't been affected.

00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:46.390
He's always been a vigorous man, after all.

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:48.260
That's rather troublesome.

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:51.100
If he's going to die, the sooner we know the better.

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:53.830
Yes, that way we could decide
what position to take.

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:23.330
Let us pray that His Majesty gets well.

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:24.850
Y-Yes.

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:31.740
Keep your concentration and march!

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:34.540
Hey, you! In the third row!

00:08:34.540 --> 00:08:36.040
Slack off and you'll be dismissed!

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:38.990
Really now?! You call yourselves
the Royal Guards like that?!

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:41.150
What has gotten into her?

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:43.010
The Commander isn't herself today.

00:08:43.010 --> 00:08:46.150
She should just leave the training
of the new guards to me.

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:48.960
Oscar can't stay still.

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:50.800
Can't you see that?

00:08:51.890 --> 00:08:53.090
Did you say something?

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:55.680
No, it's nothing.

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:58.560
They say your mouth can lead to trouble.

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:00.190
Know your place when you speak.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.100
Yes.

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:03.730
Lady Oscar.

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:06.980
It's about Madame du Barry...

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:08.730
Madame du Barry?

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:11.780
Yes, she would like you to visit her quarters.

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:14.750
She must be up to something.

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:16.080
Commander, I'll accompany you!

00:09:16.710 --> 00:09:18.280
No, I'll go alone.

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:21.250
But who knows what she's up to! It's dangerous!

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:23.740
I don't want to cause an
unnecessary ruckus at such a time.

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:43.040
I would like to ask you for a favor.

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:45.340
W-Well...

00:09:46.740 --> 00:09:50.480
About Lady Antoinette... I would like
things to be more amicable between us.

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:52.690
I would also like to apologize for
what has happened in the past.

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:01.990
T-There have been some trivial
incidents between us,

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:05.760
but I've never held any ill-will
towards her, even from the start.

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:07.700
Please!

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:12.840
I am asking you to help me, Oscar, so I can
become friends with Lady Antoinette!

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:20.350
I cannot.

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:24.600
Unfortunately, I am in no position to do so.

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:26.120
Yes, but please!

00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:29.190
If anyone, you can change Lady Antoinette's mind!

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:30.770
Oscar, please!

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:35.590
It's too late.

00:10:35.590 --> 00:10:40.000
If only you had shown such sincerity
to Lady Antoinette sooner...

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:41.870
Excuse me.

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:43.460
Wait!

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:48.040
Speak righteously all you want,
but you must value your life!

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:52.000
<i>Now, if you don't want that beautiful
face of yours covered in blood...</i>

00:10:55.010 --> 00:10:57.340
Well, let me hear your answer again!

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:21.130
<i>I-I must find a way to secure
my own safety no matter what!</i>

00:11:29.150 --> 00:11:30.960
What? Madame du Barry has...?

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:32.480
Yes.

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:35.170
She said there is something she'd
like to discuss with you in secret.

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:38.630
Have her leave.

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:40.120
What?

00:11:40.120 --> 00:11:42.330
I said send her away immediately.

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:43.590
Yes, Sir!

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:46.760
<i>That woman is no longer of use to me.</i>

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:50.170
<i>What power could the mistress
of a dying king have?</i>

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:54.440
Please open up!

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:56.020
Please open the gate!

00:11:56.510 --> 00:11:58.280
Please! Open up!

00:11:58.610 --> 00:11:59.440
Open up...

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:05.950
I refuse to lose...

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:08.280
I won't be defeated!

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:10.790
Rush the carriage back!

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:11.960
Back to Versailles!

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:12.920
Back to His Majesty!

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:46.700
W-Wait!

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:50.380
Do you intend on abandoning
His Majesty like this?!

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:54.420
There must be something you can still do!

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:01.740
<i>Ten days after the King became bedridden,</i>

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:04.510
<i>the doctors finally gave up and left the sickroom,</i>

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:07.840
<i>as the King's condition had worsened severely.</i>

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:19.320
Please... Please be strong...

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:21.570
Your Majesty is all I have...!

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:22.660
Du Barry...

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:27.300
You will stay with me until the end, but...

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:30.160
But I'm done for...

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:32.100
You mustn't say such weak-minded things!

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:36.110
The previous King, Louis XIV, known as
the Sun King, lived to be the old age of 77!

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:38.540
Your Majesty is only 64 years old!

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:40.960
Please have courage!

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:44.650
Yes, Your Majesty is the Sun to me.

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:47.480
A Sun shining with vigor and dignity.

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:52.520
I am a Sunflower in full bloom,
basking in the rays of your light...

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:55.580
Sunflowers cannot bloom without the Sun.

00:13:57.030 --> 00:13:58.100
Please...

00:13:58.100 --> 00:13:59.960
Please shine upon me!

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:04.090
What would happen to this world,
if the Sun should be no longer?!

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:27.260
This is the end...

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:27.880
Your Majesty!

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:30.490
Please... bring me the bishop...

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:33.140
I-I want to confess...

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:42.560
If His Majesty truly wishes to be forgiven by the Lord
in his final moments and enter Heaven...

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:45.910
Prove yourself by banishing the mistress
you've kept at your side,

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:48.550
as such is an insult to God and
against Christ's teachings.

00:14:48.550 --> 00:14:50.450
Madame du Barry!

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:54.080
Firstly, you must banish Madame du Barry from Versailles!

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:56.750
Banish Madame du Barry from Versailles!

00:14:57.860 --> 00:14:58.960
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!!

00:14:58.960 --> 00:14:59.710
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!!

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:02.630
His Majesty has already made his decision!

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:04.860
No!

00:15:04.860 --> 00:15:07.510
I won't leave His Majesty's
side until the very end!

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:11.500
You can't! You have been
banished from Versailles!

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:13.340
No, I won't leave him!

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:14.470
Let me go to His Majesty's side!

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:15.970
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!!

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:17.700
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!!

00:15:20.380 --> 00:15:21.940
Du Barry...

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:24.620
My grandfather is dying.

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:27.890
It's as though the entire
world is falling down on me.

00:15:27.890 --> 00:15:30.490
I'm only 19 years old...

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:33.690
Yet, I must become king and rule a country...?

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:34.870
The burden is crushing...!

00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:45.400
He gave his confession and received
his last rites, but he isn't dead yet?

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:47.460
He's clinging to life rather tenaciously.

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:50.410
That candle, placed by his sickroom window,

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:53.600
is supposed to be extinguished
when he dies, but...

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:16.860
I-It's gone out!

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:19.340
T-The King is dead!

00:16:19.340 --> 00:16:20.500
The King is dead!

00:16:23.840 --> 00:16:25.180
The King is dead!

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:27.540
The King is dead! The King is dead!

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:54.660
What could be that noise?

00:16:58.080 --> 00:16:59.120
Madame Noailles?!

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:02.080
T-The King is dead...

00:17:11.990 --> 00:17:14.320
Congratulations, Lady Antoinette.

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:17.430
From this moment on, you are
the Queen of France.

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:19.180
Grandfather...

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:20.760
...has finally passed away.

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:22.770
Long live King Louis XVI!

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:24.440
Long live the King!

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:26.370
Long live His Queen!

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:28.600
Long live the King!

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:31.810
God, please...

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:34.010
Please protect us.

00:17:34.010 --> 00:17:39.240
Please protect us, as we must rule as
King and Queen at such a young age...

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:44.190
Long live the new King, Louis XVI!

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:45.850
Long live the King!

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:50.090
The King is dead. Long live the King?

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.590
They haven't even paid their
respects to his body yet.

00:17:53.900 --> 00:17:55.370
Such a shrewd bunch.

00:17:55.370 --> 00:17:58.340
A moment ago, they were trying
to win Louis XV's favors.

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:00.220
But that's how people's hearts truly work.

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:03.440
The sun sets, the sun rises.

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:05.310
Those who prosper will one day perish.

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:08.310
Without a new sun to bask in, people cannot live.

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:14.510
Commander?

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:16.190
Take charge of the rest.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:29.800
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:31.030
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:33.360
Hurry up and get in!

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:33.360
Your Majesty...!

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:37.810
Stop giving me a hard time!

00:18:37.810 --> 00:18:40.180
You're just a woman now!

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:41.180
And the lowest kind at that!

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:43.230
I'll show you!

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:53.820
Stop roughing her up.

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:55.990
I'll accompany Madame du Barry midway.

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:56.990
Y-Yes.

00:19:11.140 --> 00:19:13.840
There are a number of people
who bear malice towards you.

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:15.510
Your pity isn't necessary.

00:19:15.510 --> 00:19:17.710
There's also a rumor that you might be attacked.

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:18.390
I'll accompany you.

00:19:38.770 --> 00:19:41.740
We're a long ways from the Palace of Versailles now.

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:43.820
The rumor about an attack was a lie, wasn't it?

00:19:46.810 --> 00:19:51.320
Just as everyone was gossiping,
I'm a prostitute who rose the ranks.

00:19:51.320 --> 00:19:55.020
Oscar, you probably don't know
how miserable and hard...

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:57.920
...it is to worry about tomorrow's bread, do you?

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:02.530
I used to do anything just to get some bread.

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:04.560
I couldn't care less if it were evil.

00:20:04.560 --> 00:20:07.860
After great pains, I finally
managed to become a Countess.

00:20:07.860 --> 00:20:11.030
And soon after, I received His Majesty's affections.

00:20:11.030 --> 00:20:13.370
But then, somehow instead of bread,

00:20:13.370 --> 00:20:16.690
I began to crave diamonds and dresses one
after another, as if I were starved for them.

00:20:22.710 --> 00:20:24.870
I wonder if I'll be executed...?

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:28.550
But I have no regrets.

00:20:28.550 --> 00:20:31.790
After all, everything I did, I did because
that is what I had desired.

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:38.300
Stop the carriage.

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:40.130
Halt!

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:46.740
This is far enough.

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:47.930
Thank you, Oscar.

00:20:51.510 --> 00:20:56.210
I haven't felt this gentle since I lost
my mother when I was 5 years old.

00:20:56.210 --> 00:20:57.860
You're such a wondrous person...

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:03.720
I'm a woman who can quickly forget her past.

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:06.460
I may be an out-of-season Sunflower now,

00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:08.390
but I swear I'll bloom again someday.

00:21:08.390 --> 00:21:10.210
All right, please go!

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:11.720
Go!

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:21.170
<i>Madame du Barry was exiled to the Abbey
of Pont-aux-Dames, located east of Paris.</i>

00:21:22.070 --> 00:21:24.880
<i>As the King's mistress,</i>

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:29.470
<i>she monopolized the King's affections, and lived in the lap of luxury and extravagance.</i>

00:21:29.880 --> 00:21:33.850
<i>Having once made even Antoinette bow down at her feet,</i>

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:36.480
<i>it would be the end of Madame du Barry</i>

00:21:37.490 --> 00:21:42.630
<i>In 1793, by the order of the Revolutionary Tribunal,</i>

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:45.890
<i>she would become a stain on the guillotine platform.</i>

00:21:53.100 --> 00:21:56.240
<i>The coffin of the former King, Louis XV,</i>

00:21:56.240 --> 00:22:00.140
<i>was transported to the Basilica of Saint Denis
for burial in the dead of night.</i>

00:22:00.840 --> 00:22:05.630
<i>Guarding the coffin were just 40 Royal Guards...</i>

00:22:05.630 --> 00:22:08.770
<i>...and 36 footmen.</i>

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:14.320
<i>The old, and the new...</i>

00:22:14.320 --> 00:22:16.590
<i>The prosperous, and the perishing...</i>

00:22:17.290 --> 00:22:22.160
<i>Touched by the unyielding flow of human history,</i>

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:25.600
<i>Oscar could not contain her heart's sorrow.</i>

00:22:27.870 --> 00:22:32.370
